The V4 Pro two-phase schedule follows the measured
`dsh-anchored-standard` bootstrap (first request = official two-tool
schema, later requests restore the host catalog after a durable
promotion signal):

  https://github.com/xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard

pi-dsh-minimal v0.2.0 also ported the V4 Flash weak persona and
classify/converge guidance from `dsh-mode-boost` /
`dsh-router-standard`; that Flash path was removed in v0.3.0 after a
controlled DeepSWE A/B measured no lift. No Flash surface is shipped.

